  "description": "<p>Lakeview Heights is a completed gated development off Whitefield Main Road, four towers arranged around a central landscaped court with the clubhouse on the podium. 3 BHK Apartment of 1,650 sq ft, part of a project with 3 configurations from ₹88.5 L, priced at ₹1.24 Cr (about ₹7,515 per square foot).</p><p>The living room and the primary bedroom face the open side of each block, which keeps the interiors bright through the day. Residents have access to swimming pool, clubhouse, gymnasium and landscaped gardens among 18 listed amenities.</p><p>Whitefield sits in east Bengaluru; Hope Farm Metro Station is about 1.5 km away and Forum Shantiniketan Mall roughly 2.6 km. The locality page sets out the wider picture.</p><p>The property is ready to move into, about 2 years old, with no construction risk left to carry. Lakeview Heights is a fictional project created for this dataset: the name, the pricing, the approvals and the photographs are placeholders, and the record should be replaced with a real listing before the site goes live.</p>",
